    "This manual covers the interface and basic operations of the Netto Firewall: starting and stopping the firewall, setting network permissions for individual apps, and reviewing recent events.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This manual covers the interface and basic operations of the Netto Firewall: starting and stopping the firewall, setting network permissions for individual apps, and reviewing recent events."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本手册介绍 Netto 防火墙的界面与基本操作:启动和停止防火墙、为单个应用设置网络权限,以及查看最近事件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本手冊介紹 Netto 防火牆的介面與基本操作:啟動和停止防火牆、為個別應用程式設定網路權限,以及檢視最近事件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本手冊介紹 Netto 防火牆的介面與基本操作:啟動和停止防火牆、為個別應用程式設定網路權限,以及檢視最近事件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本手冊介紹 Netto 防火牆的介面與基本操作:啟動和停止防火牆、為個別應用程式設定網路權限,以及檢視最近事件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
