    "Header: the plugin title, a status badge showing the firewall state, and the Start / Stop button.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Header: the plugin title, a status badge showing the firewall state, and the Start / Stop button."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "顶部状态栏:显示插件标题、表示防火墙状态的状态徽章,以及「启动 / 停止」按钮。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "頂部狀態列:顯示插件標題、表示防火牆狀態的狀態徽章,以及「啟動 / 停止」按鈕。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "頂部狀態列:顯示插件標題、表示防火牆狀態的狀態徽章,以及「啟動 / 停止」按鈕。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "頂部狀態列:顯示插件標題、表示防火牆狀態的狀態徽章,以及「啟動 / 停止」按鈕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps list: each app with its icon, name, and bundle identifier; the switch on each row controls its network permission.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apps list: each app with its icon, name, and bundle identifier; the switch on each row controls its network permission."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「应用」列表:每个应用显示图标、名称和包标识符,行尾的开关控制该应用的网络权限。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「應用程式」列表:每個應用程式顯示圖示、名稱和套件識別碼,行尾的開關控制該應用程式的網路權限。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「應用程式」列表:每個應用程式顯示圖示、名稱和套件識別碼,行尾的開關控制該應用程式的網路權限。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「應用程式」列表:每個應用程式顯示圖示、名稱和套件識別碼,行尾的開關控制該應用程式的網路權限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recent Events list: recent connections with an allowed or denied mark, the address and port, the app, and the time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recent Events list: recent connections with an allowed or denied mark, the address and port, the app, and the time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「最近事件」列表:每条连接显示允许或拒绝标记、地址与端口、所属应用及时间。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「最近事件」列表:每條連線顯示允許或拒絕標記、位址與連接埠、所屬應用程式及時間。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「最近事件」列表:每條連線顯示允許或拒絕標記、位址與連接埠、所屬應用程式及時間。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW": {
